Free TURN by default + one-click free deploy (Vercel button, Render blueprint)

- ICE route now ships working NAT traversal with ZERO config: multiple public
  STUN servers + Metered Open Relay free public TURN (disable via
  DISABLE_FREE_TURN, override with TURN_URLS/COTURN). Peers connect out of the
  box on a free host.
- bin/peerjs.js binds to $PORT (works on Render/Railway/Fly), adds a health route
- render.yaml blueprint: deploy the app + a self-hosted PeerJS server on free
  tiers with free *.onrender.com subdomains (no card, no domain)
- README: 3-minute free deploy quickstart with a Deploy-to-Vercel button and
  the Render Blueprint option

